    <item>
      <title>Is Claude Conscious? Inside Anthropic’s Quest to Instill Morality Into Its A.I. Models</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/29/us/anthropic-claude-morals-ai.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/29/us/anthropic-claude-morals-ai.html</guid>
